\toprule
Dataset & $n$ & Greedy & Degen\% & LP $\rho$ & LP $\Delta$ & $p$ \\
\midrule
CoNLL & 2{,}756 & .908 & 59.1\% & .302 & $-$1.05\,pp & 1.0 \\
SciERC & 529 & .644 & 17.8\% & .215 & $+$0.61\,pp & .193 \\
Few-NERD & 32{,}565 & .748 & 13.8\% & .421 & $\mathbf{+1.36}$\,pp & ${<}.001$ \\
